{
  "_comment": "Survival rulesets. One Conditions system, tuned by data: 'hardcore' only lists what differs from 'light'. Every condition is a 0-100 severity (0 = fine). Each rate applies while all its 'when' flags are set and none of its 'unless' flags are; values are per minute. Bands apply their mods while the value is inside [from, to). Mods ending in _mult multiply, all others add. Flags the server sets: day, night, exposed, sheltered, near_heat, high_altitude, dusty, sprinting, fighting, resting, at_tether, plus flags from carried gear and buffs (masked, calm). 'earth_weight' rises only inside Occlusion sites, where Earth gravity returns: the castaway is strong on Aruun and ordinary there, so those sites are harder.",
